\paragraph{Prompt Initialization}
For initializing prompts, Prompt Editor uses the learned taxonomy as a template to generate an initial version of the prompt. To ensure that the prompt is relevant to the user's task, users provide task-specific information for the system to use as context and populate the prompt template.
